# Norway, February 2026

Three nights above the Arctic Circle, chasing
the **aurora** from Tromsø to the Lofoten.

## Packing list

- [x] Tripod and spare batteries
- [x] Wool layers, *lots* of them
- [ ] Offline maps on the USB drive

## Shot notes

> Wide open at f/2, 4 seconds, ISO 3200.
> The green band moved faster than expected.

| Night | Kp | Clouds |
|-------|----|--------|
| Fri   | 5  | clear  |
| Sat   | 3  | broken |
